---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---
<Layout
	title="Resume"
	description="Download PDF"
	pubDate={new Date('2026-07-09 12:00:00.000')}
	draft={false}
>
	<p>
		I'm currently open to new opportunities. Here are some skill highlights:
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Backend</strong>: Experience with all versions of .NET.</li>
			<li><strong>Frontend</strong>: Angular, Vuejs, Astro, React.</li>
			<li><strong>SQL</strong>: Entity Framework combined with raw SQL when needed.</li>
			<li><strong>DevOps</strong>: Experience with Azure DevOps, AWS, and Cloudflare.</li>
			<li><strong>IoT</strong>: Prototyping with CircuitPython and Arduino.</li>
			<li><strong>AI Tools</strong>: Cursor, Claude Code, Ollama.</li>
		</ul>
	</p>
	<div class="pdf-viewer">
		<object data="/shawn-renner.pdf#pagemode=none" type="application/pdf">
			<p>
				Your browser doesn't support embedded PDFs.
				<a href="/shawn-renner.pdf">Download instead</a>.
			</p>
		</object>
	</div>
</Layout>
<style>
.pdf-viewer {
	width: 100%;
	max-width: 850px;
	aspect-ratio: 8.5 / 11;
	border: 1px solid #ccc;
	margin: 2rem auto;
}
.pdf-viewer object {
	display: block;
	width: 100%;
	height: 100%;
}
</style>